{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368","id":175390186,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNzUzOTAxODY=","number":6368,"title":"Possible data loss -- fsync parent directories ","user":{"login":"ramanala","id":6288907,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODg5MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6288907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala","html_url":"https://github.com/ramanala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramanala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":46697272,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NjY5NzI3Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"d61552","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/milestones/30","html_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/milestone/30","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/milestones/30/labels","id":1735265,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTczNTI2NQ==","number":30,"title":"v3.1.0","description":"Proxy!","creator":{"login":"xiang90","id":4479947,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Nzk5NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4479947?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90","html_url":"https://github.com/xiang90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":128,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-04-27T23:53:02Z","updated_at":"2018-04-26T22:32:40Z","due_on":"2016-12-31T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2017-01-13T21:47:52Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-09-07T01:16:45Z","updated_at":"2020-04-02T08:27:52Z","closed_at":"2016-09-08T19:56:50Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I am running a three node etcd cluster. When I insert a new key value pair into the store, I see the following sequence of system calls on the server. \n\n1 creat(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal.tmp\")\n2 append(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal.tmp\")\n3 fdatasync(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal.tmp\")\n4 rename(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal.tmp\", \"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n5 append(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n6 append(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n7 fdatasync(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n8 append(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n9 fdatasync(\"/data/etcd/infra0.etcd/member/wal/0000000000000001-000000000000001b.wal\")\n==========Data is durable here -- Ack the user====================\n\nFor the 4th operation (rename of wal.tmp to wal) to be persisted to disk, the parent directory has to be fsync'd. If not, a crash just after acknowledging the user can result in a data loss. Specifically, the rename can be reordered on some file systems, thus not issued immediately by the fs. In such a case, on recovery, the server would see the file wal.tmp but not wal. On seeing this, I believe etcd just unlinks the tmp file and therefore can lose the user data. If this happens on two nodes on a three node cluster, then a global data loss is possible.  We have reproduced this particular data loss issue using our testing framework. As a fix, it would be safe to fsync the parent directory on creat or rename of files.\n","closed_by":{"login":"heyitsanthony","id":16294350,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjk0MzUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16294350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony","html_url":"https://github.com/heyitsanthony","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6368/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}